<title>JAPAN: Unisia Jecs - 7-mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Unisia Jecs - 7-mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>		    7-mths result		  full-yr result</p>
<p> Sales		122.82		vs	  217.71</p>
<p> Operating	    2.25		vs	    3.72</p>
<p> Current		2.20		vs	    2.99</p>
<p> Net		  937    million    vs	    1.35</p>
<p> EPS		    6.12 yen	  vs	    8.83 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	     -		vs		 -</p>
<p> Shares	    153 million	  vs	 153 million</p>
<p> Ord div		4.40 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Unisia Jecs Corp is a car parts maker affiliated</p>
<p>with Nissan Motor Co Ltd. The latest results were</p>
<p>for the seven-month period to September 30, 1996, because</p>
<p>the company changed its business term.</p>
</text>
